"i","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"configuration","recommendation":"Ограничьте bind loopback/private-интерфейсом и защитите доступ аутентификацией.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/668.html"]}},{"ruleId":"CFG003","contentHash":"ed0b62db021f1d7add25bc43742258ab66a1abdaf19478d784c683ac45164daa","definition":{"id":"CFG003","languages":["javascript","typescript","python","java","php","go","csharp","ruby","kotlin","rust","swift","scala","shell","config","unknown"],"title":"Небезопасные права доступа","description":"Файлу назначаются права 0777 или эквивалентный chmod.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-732","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"(?:chmod\\s+(?:-R\\s+)?777\\b|chmod\\s*\\([^\\n,]+,\\s*0?777\\)|mode\\s*:\\s*0?777)","patternFlags":"i","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"configuration","recommendation":"Назначьте минимально необходимые права и отдельного владельца.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/732.html"]}},{"ruleId":"CRYPTO002","contentHash":"bb6eaeae05ab530a6bf176c2d044ecac2c79919726eb85dc8aef4d82902cf15a","definition":{"id":"CRYPTO002","languages":["javascript","typescript","python","java","php","go","csharp","ruby","kotlin","rust","swift","scala","shell","config","unknown"],"title":"Режим шифрования ECB","description":"ECB раскрывает структуру повторяющихся блоков данных.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-327","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"(?:AES|DES)[-_/]?(?:\\d+[-_/]?)?ECB|MODE_ECB|\\/ECB\\/","patternFlags":"i","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"crypto","recommendation":"Используйте AEAD: AES-GCM или ChaCha20-Poly1305 с уникальным nonce.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/327.html"]}},{"ruleId":"CRYPTO003","contentHash":"02f1338dd169d9ca96e0cec3d6429739afd0c9b34b28f31a68d19f92e01b72d8","definition":{"id":"CRYPTO003","languages":["javascript","typescript","python","java","php","go","csharp","ruby","kotlin","rust","swift","scala","shell","config","unknown"],"title":"Статический IV или nonce","description":"IV/nonce задан константой и может повторяться при шифровании.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-329","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"(?:iv|nonce|initializationVector)\\s*[:=]\\s*(?:[\"''][A-Za-z0-9+/=_-]{8,}[\"'']|Buffer\\.alloc\\s*\\([^)]*\\))","patternFlags":"i","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"crypto","recommendation":"Генерируйте уникальный nonce криптографическим RNG для каждой операции.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/329.html"]}},{"ruleId":"AUTH001","contentHash":"65c3d62cfc6e376462b542b0f2cfadab508e26039f4d28a1537b46b3efcbcaa0","definition":{"id":"AUTH001","languages":["javascript","typescript","python","java","php","go","csharp","ruby","kotlin","rust","swift","scala","shell","config","unknown"],"title":"Сравнение секрета без constant-time","description":"Секрет или подпись сравнивается обычным оператором.","severity":"medium","cwe":"CWE-208","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"(?:password|token|signature|hmac|secret)\\s*(?:===?|!==?)\\s*[A-Za-z_$\"'']","patternFlags":"i","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"authentication","recommendation":"Для MAC, токенов и ключей используйте constant-time compare.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/208.html"]}},{"ruleId":"RS001","contentHash":"18ad6e4b066bafa04fb79dccf4b81672f1e6f1778e335b6c62ce3ade2ccc12f8","definition":{"id":"RS001","languages":["rust"],"title":"Команда через системную оболочку","description":"Rust-приложение запускает shell с текстовой командой, что повышает риск командной инъекции.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-78","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"Command::new\\s*\\(\\s*\"(?:sh|bash)\"\\s*\\)[\\s\\S]{0,240}\\.arg\\s*\\(\\s*\"-c\"\\s*\\)","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"file","category":"injection","recommendation":"Запускайте фиксированный бинарник напрямую и передавайте проверенные аргументы отдельными вызовами arg/args.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/78.html"]}},{"ruleId":"RS002","contentHash":"a5e8cf0838d7042cf2d1eb83ede4091811ed58d7a8e02a7be070bd4f1fb23bd0","definition":{"id":"RS002","languages":["rust"],"title":"Отключена проверка TLS","description":"HTTP-клиент принимает недействительные TLS-сертификаты.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-295","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"danger_accept_invalid_(?:certs|hostnames)\\s*\\(\\s*true\\s*\\)","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"transport","recommendation":"Включите проверку сертификата и имени узла, при необходимости настройте доверенный корневой сертификат.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/295.html"]}},{"ruleId":"RS003","contentHash":"335d66942f55d3e14333a936581b5290ebcd51d882f3002afe764a3e86aee55f","definition":{"id":"RS003","languages":["rust"],"title":"Небезопасная десериализация бинарных данных","description":"Десериализация bincode из недоверенного источника может вызвать отказ в обслуживании или неконтролируемое выделение памяти.","severity":"medium","cwe":"CWE-502","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\bbincode::deserialize(?:_from)?\\s*\\(","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"deserialization","recommendation":"Ограничьте размер входа, применяйте лимиты bincode и проверяйте структуру результата.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/502.html"]}},{"ruleId":"RS004","contentHash":"a5b3ad89c3c08bee3ab94aaac738f0e082b9a0a4b83dc1337782570ed1b934a8","definition":{"id":"RS004","languages":["rust"],"title":"SQL-запрос через format!","description":"SQL-команда формируется строковой интерполяцией перед выполнением.","severity":"critical","cwe":"CWE-89","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"(?:query|execute|query_as)\\s*\\(\\s*&?format!\\s*\\(","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"injection","recommendation":"Используйте параметризованный запрос и bind-параметры вместо format!.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/89.html"]}},{"ruleId":"SWIFT001","contentHash":"a08a531ccbd64c0602560e3acfd89b24d1e5eac98a0099d0e05774585b9a66f3","definition":{"id":"SWIFT001","languages":["swift"],"title":"Команда через shell","description":"Process запускает системную оболочку с командной строкой.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-78","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"executableURL\\s*=\\s*URL\\s*\\(\\s*fileURLWithPath:\\s*\"\\/(?:bin\\/(?:sh|bash)|usr\\/bin\\/env)\"\\s*\\)[\\s\\S]{0,320}(?:\"-c\"|\"bash\"|\"sh\")","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"file","category":"injection","recommendation":"Запускайте требуемый executable напрямую и передавайте проверенные аргументы массивом.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/78.html"]}},{"ruleId":"SWIFT002","contentHash":"01a09c366f89306566bdf677286ff2b72856fba491ef62684da3d386a6bd1a6e","definition":{"id":"SWIFT002","languages":["swift"],"title":"Отключена проверка TLS","description":"Обработчик URLSession безусловно принимает серверный сертификат.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-295","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"useCredential\\s*,\\s*credential:\\s*URLCredential\\s*\\(\\s*trust:","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"transport","recommendation":"Используйте performDefaultHandling или явно проверьте trust, hostname и цепочку сертификатов.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/295.html"]}},{"ruleId":"SWIFT003","contentHash":"e63b9788e0c872d1e4ef5df9c5f298fad5ac7bee1d1272e19fb9a31c2ba8f07a","definition":{"id":"SWIFT003","languages":["swift"],"title":"Слабая криптографическая хеш-функция","description":"Приложение использует MD5 или SHA-1.","severity":"medium","cwe":"CWE-327","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"\\b(?:Insecure\\.)?(?:MD5|SHA1)\\.(?:hash|init)\\s*\\(|CC_(?:MD5|SHA1)\\s*\\(","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"crypto","recommendation":"Используйте SHA-256/512 для целостности; для паролей применяйте специализированный password hashing.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/327.html"]}},{"ruleId":"SWIFT004","contentHash":"abb47ff4bbed84cb922c1971c648ddf5a1bd4f52f0cadc0900225b37e658aff5","definition":{"id":"SWIFT004","languages":["swift"],"title":"Динамический JavaScript в WebView","description":"WKWebView выполняет динамически сформированную строку JavaScript.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-95","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"evaluateJavaScript\\s*\\([^\\n)]*(?:\\+|\\\\\\(|interpolat)","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"injection","recommendation":"Не собирайте JavaScript из недоверенных данных; используйте структурированный message handler и строгую проверку значений.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/95.html"]}},{"ruleId":"SCALA001","contentHash":"60ff0346a2720697226943319962b77396b6437c494c227518b28401c5870ca8","definition":{"id":"SCALA001","languages":["scala"],"title":"Командная инъекция Scala","description":"Shell-команда формируется интерполяцией перед запуском процесса.","severity":"critical","cwe":"CWE-78","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"s[\"''][^\"''\\n]*\\$[^\"''\\n]*[\"'']\\s*\\.!{1,2}\\b|Process\\s*\\(\\s*s[\"''][^\"''\\n]*\\$","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"injection","recommendation":"Передавайте executable и проверенные аргументы последовательностью без shell-интерпретации.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/78.html"]}},{"ruleId":"SCALA002","contentHash":"8af8fb39474df29dd1cd3a5df1236838ce074ea50c2022560290318d3ea25369","definition":{"id":"SCALA002","languages":["scala"],"title":"Небезопасная Java-десериализация","description":"ObjectInputStream может создать опасную цепочку объектов из недоверенных данных.","severity":"critical","cwe":"CWE-502","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"\\b(?:new\\s+)?ObjectInputStream\\s*\\(|\\.readObject\\s*\\(","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"deserialization","recommendation":"Откажитесь от Java serialization либо используйте строгий ObjectInputFilter allowlist.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/502.html"]}},{"ruleId":"SCALA003","contentHash":"d5ddd4bec49fb1c0d42f7f7985bccb33795c03971890c736ad9be6ae52fdfc64","definition":{"id":"SCALA003","languages":["scala"],"title":"SQL-запрос через интерполяцию","description":"SQL-команда строится из интерполированной строки.","severity":"critical","cwe":"CWE-89","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"(?:executeQuery|executeUpdate|execute|sql)\\s*\\(\\s*s[\"''][^\"''\\n]*\\$","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"injection","recommendation":"Используйте prepared statement или типобезопасные bind-параметры.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/89.html"]}},{"ruleId":"SH001","contentHash":"070525942c1a76a398fb8737c7ed45e136545e762f2dc1b743be83173bff6893","definition":{"id":"SH001","languages":["shell"],"title":"Выполнение загруженного скрипта","description":"Данные из сети напрямую передаются интерпретатору команд.","severity":"critical","cwe":"CWE-494","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"\\b(?:curl|wget)\\b[^\\n|]*(?:\\||-O\\s*-)[^\\n]*\\b(?:sh|bash|zsh)\\b","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"supply-chain","recommendation":"Загрузите файл отдельно, проверьте подпись или хеш и только затем запускайте зафиксированную версию.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/494.html"]}},{"ruleId":"SH002","contentHash":"b562113e0342300e199e3f8f24a6fe07ac0642f0fc8e9e1bc6154f3437673e95","definition":{"id":"SH002","languages":["shell"],"title":"eval с подстановкой переменной","description":"eval повторно интерпретирует содержимое переменной как shell-код.","severity":"critical","cwe":"CWE-95","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"\\beval\\s+[\"'']?\\$\\{?[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*\\}?","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"injection","recommendation":"Удалите eval; используйте массив аргументов, case или явное сопоставление разрешённых команд.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/95.html"]}},{"ruleId":"SH003","contentHash":"e9197360c1fa5282ab0d4f16a3a3fdc8ed9c69e7a91faaf3ad35d7b637c3de3f","definition":{"id":"SH003","languages":["shell"],"title":"Небезопасное имя временного файла","description":"mktemp -u возвращает имя без атомарного создания файла и допускает race condition.","severity":"medium","cwe":"CWE-377","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"\\bmktemp\\s+(?:[^\\n]*\\s)?-u\\b|\\bmktemp\\s+-u\\b","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"filesystem","recommendation":"Создавайте временный файл обычным mktemp и сохраняйте созданный путь с ограниченными правами.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/377.html"]}},{"ruleId":"SH004","contentHash":"6ea35271f089bb3a4cc9020a103cf80a012a0321206b87593d4e47aeebe961d1","definition":{"id":"SH004","languages":["shell"],"title":"Отключена проверка TLS","description":"curl или wget принимает недоверенный TLS-сертификат.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-295","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"\\b(?:curl\\s+[^\\n]*(?:--insecure|-k)\\b|wget\\s+[^\\n]*--no-check-certificate\\b)","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"transport","recommendation":"Удалите отключение проверки TLS и настройте доверенный CA bundle.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/295.html"]}},{"ruleId":"CFG004","contentHash":"32cfa9633c6b5c3a9fcd40d1b545dcde01cb8953e3696ce07735ffb2065eea8b","definition":{"id":"CFG004","languages":["config"],"title":"Контейнер запускается от root","description":"Dockerfile или конфигурация контейнера явно выбирает пользователя root.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-250","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"^(?:\\s*USER\\s+(?:root|0)\\s*$|\\s*runAsUser\\s*:\\s*0\\s*$)","patternFlags":"im","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"file","category":"configuration","recommendation":"Создайте непривилегированного пользователя и запускайте процесс с минимальными правами.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/250.html"]}},{"ruleId":"CFG005","contentHash":"7553399ca8f8b110a454d8d48a1af13e10379b8dcb660750c18a2e1114dc51c9","definition":{"id":"CFG005","languages":["config"],"title":"Разрешено повышение привилегий","description":"Контейнер Kubernetes разрешает процессу получать дополнительные привилегии.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-250","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"allowPrivilegeEscalation\\s*:\\s*true","patternFlags":"i","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"configuration","recommendation":"Установите allowPrivilegeEscalation: false и удалите ненужные capabilities.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/250.html"]}},{"ruleId":"CFG006","contentHash":"89a556c0ebf5ab371c3f2cb6c5a9985d8d08f260ef8a9e496ba0d3b07e3e88b5","definition":{"id":"CFG006","languages":["config"],"title":"Host namespace в Kubernetes","description":"Pod использует сетевое, процессное или IPC-пространство имён узла.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-250","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"\\bhost(?:Network|PID|IPC)\\s*:\\s*true","patternFlags":"i","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"configuration","recommendation":"Изолируйте pod от namespace узла; включайте host namespace только для обоснованных системных компонентов.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/250.html"]}},{"ruleId":"CFG007","contentHash":"dc63f7bff598792710715d6b3225cad8bb04416937f7512030af5ad58a7cd73c","definition":{"id":"CFG007","languages":["config"],"title":"Публичный доступ из любой сети","description":"Сетевое правило разрешает входящий доступ со всех IPv4-адресов.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-284","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"(?:cidr_blocks?|sourceRanges?|ipBlock|CidrIp)\\s*[:=][^\\n]*(?:0\\.0\\.0\\.0\\/0)|-\\s*0\\.0\\.0\\.0\\/0","patternFlags":"i","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"configuration","recommendation":"Ограничьте CIDR доверенными сетями и откройте только необходимые порты.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/284.html"]}},{"ruleId":"CFG008","contentHash":"a622d9221e87d0d11f931e9dff99891382ef49bb6fd0ccdf8ebd6e9181639626","definition":{"id":"CFG008","languages":["config"],"title":"Плавающий тег контейнерного образа","description":"Конфигурация использует изменяемый тег latest и не фиксирует содержимое образа.","severity":"low","cwe":"CWE-1104","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"\\bimage\\s*:\\s*[\"'']?[A-Za-z0-9._\\/-]+:latest\\b","patternFlags":"i","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"supply-chain","recommendation":"Закрепите образ по неизменяемому digest или конкретной проверенной версии.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/1104.html"]}},{"ruleId":"JS020","contentHash":"645b58138ddd7a98661588eefd64fa3853a73e697886ea923e02cba4b6c67318","definition":{"id":"JS020","languages":["javascript","typescript"],"title":"Отключена проверка TLS в Node.js","description":"HTTP-запросы принимают недействительные TLS-сертификаты.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-295","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"\\brejectUnauthorized\\s*:\\s*false\\b","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"transport","recommendation":"Оставьте проверку сертификата включённой и настройте доверенный CA.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/295.html"]}},{"ruleId":"PY020","contentHash":"cecd886286c95a03b31582a225b8033d06841e9104ef9c6717076a2b250e193b","definition":{"id":"PY020","languages":["python"],"title":"Отключена проверка TLS в requests","description":"Клиент requests принимает недействительные TLS-сертификаты.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-295","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"\\brequests\\.(?:get|post|put|patch|delete|request)\\s*\\([^\\n]*\\bverify\\s*=\\s*False\\b","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"transport","recommendation":"Удалите verify=False и настройте доверенный CA.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/295.html"]}},{"ruleId":"GO020","contentHash":"9efd6c45387e614c4a0a27787a29d8615f2b1d0458c5a923b81c1d48d0400307","definition":{"id":"GO020","languages":["go"],"title":"Отключена проверка TLS в Go","description":"TLS-клиент пропускает проверку сертификата и имени сервера.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-295","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"\\bInsecureSkipVerify\\s*:\\s*true\\b","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"transport","recommendation":"Оставьте проверку TLS включённой и задайте RootCAs при необходимости.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/295.html"]}},{"ruleId":"JAVA020","contentHash":"ec82eac44375dff6d1dbd133845211c985c2a9fd71513dae566fc1ed32232ef5","definition":{"id":"JAVA020","languages":["java"],"title":"Небезопасный генератор случайных чисел","description":"java.util.Random используется для генерации токена или ключа.","severity":"medium","cwe":"CWE-338","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\b(?:token|secret|key|nonce)\\w*\\s*=\\s*(?:new\\s+)?Random\\s*\\(","patternFlags":"i","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"crypto","recommendation":"Для секретов используйте java.security.SecureRandom.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/338.html"]}},{"ruleId":"JS021","contentHash":"6f4878af7fa7f0487df5fbaaadad3b6c4c565fc3a1908a73480c8abbcb0bbfd6","definition":{"id":"JS021","languages":["javascript","typescript"],"title":"Запуск процесса через shell","description":"spawn или execFile явно включает оболочку; недоверенные аргументы могут стать командами.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-78","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\b(?:spawn|spawnSync|execFile|execFileSync)\\s*\\([^;{}]{0,600}\\{[^{}]{0,400}\\bshell\\s*:\\s*true\\b","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"file","category":"injection","recommendation":"Используйте shell: false, фиксированный executable и массив проверенных аргументов.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/78.html"]}},{"ruleId":"PY021","contentHash":"febcb590a949339efb9b1ce3536f41bdc7fc546f862c3903390057845611ccc4","definition":{"id":"PY021","languages":["python"],"title":"Небезопасный SSL-контекст","description":"SSL-контекст создаётся без проверки сертификата либо проверка явно отключена.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-295","owasp":"A02:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"\\bssl\\._create_unverified_context\\s*\\(|\\bverify_mode\\s*=\\s*ssl\\.CERT_NONE\\b","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"file","category":"transport","recommendation":"Используйте ssl.create_default_context(), CERT_REQUIRED и проверку имени сервера.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/295.html"]}},{"ruleId":"PY022","contentHash":"9b83b01d00a4083df9954a94ae5cb5be19d438c8e7e79bd15d4801ddcac344e2","definition":{"id":"PY022","languages":["python"],"title":"Отключено экранирование Jinja","description":"Jinja Environment явно отключает автоматическое экранирование; при выводе недоверенных данных в HTML возможен XSS.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-79","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\b(?:jinja2\\.)?Environment\\s*\\((?:[^();]|\\([^()]*\\)){0,400}?\\bautoescape\\s*=\\s*False\\b","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"file","category":"xss","recommendation":"Для HTML-шаблонов включите autoescape или select_autoescape([''html'', ''htm'', ''xml'']).","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/79.html"]}},{"ruleId":"JAVA021","contentHash":"a3402b691b7669122ca2a5731a43b463984472b19f1ab7ddaf4979402b396301","definition":{"id":"JAVA021","languages":["java","kotlin"],"title":"Небезопасная десериализация XMLDecoder","description":"XMLDecoder создаёт объекты и вызывает методы из XML; недоверенный документ может выполнить код.","severity":"critical","cwe":"CWE-502","owasp":"A08:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"\\b(?:new\\s+(?:java\\.beans\\.)?XMLDecoder|java\\.beans\\.XMLDecoder|XMLDecoder)\\s*\\(","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"deserialization","recommendation":"Не передавайте недоверенные документы в XMLDecoder; используйте формат данных со строгой схемой без создания произвольных объектов.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/502.html"]}},{"ruleId":"CS004","contentHash":"6e29fb26514f7a852fe5b3f8706da08471b291b0930544e7aa12ad968cf74a71","definition":{"id":"CS004","languages":["csharp"],"title":"Разрешены типы из JSON","description":"Newtonsoft.Json TypeNameHandling разрешает создавать типы, указанные в JSON; без строгого binder это опасно для недоверенного ввода.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-502","owasp":"A08:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\bTypeNameHandling\\s*=\\s*(?:Newtonsoft\\.Json\\.)?TypeNameHandling\\.(?:All|Auto|Objects|Arrays)\\b","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"file","category":"deserialization","recommendation":"Установите TypeNameHandling.None; при необходимой полиморфности применяйте строгий allowlist в ISerializationBinder.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/502.html"]}},{"ruleId":"CS005","contentHash":"118902eea31b517c11149488d456a84a31ca5b7a1b33ab9220e5113f1439228d","definition":{"id":"CS005","languages":["csharp"],"title":"Разрешена обработка DTD","description":"XML-парсер разрешает DTD; внешние сущности и расширение сущностей требуют дополнительных ограничений.","severity":"medium","cwe":"CWE-611","owasp":"A05:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\bDtdProcessing\\s*=\\s*(?:System\\.Xml\\.)?DtdProcessing\\.Parse\\b","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"file","category":"xxe","recommendation":"Установите DtdProcessing.Prohibit и XmlResolver = null; ограничьте размер документа и расширение сущностей.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/611.html"]}},{"ruleId":"PHP008","contentHash":"dc69156b6e7330ef251b7b89b2827bddda1918c76790dd961acb4a4039065423","definition":{"id":"PHP008","languages":["php"],"title":"Отключена проверка TLS в cURL","description":"cURL явно отключает проверку сертификата или имени TLS-сервера.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-295","owasp":"A02:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"\\bCURLOPT_SSL_VERIFY(?:PEER|HOST)\\s*(?:,|=>)\\s*(?:false|0)\\b","patternFlags":"i","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"file","category":"transport","recommendation":"Включите CURLOPT_SSL_VERIFYPEER и установите CURLOPT_SSL_VERIFYHOST = 2; настройте доверенный CA.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/295.html"]}},{"ruleId":"CFG009","contentHash":"506c89f3136db5088d4ded7129c16e8a8c8091225172228d81a1919055ba43c5","definition":{"id":"CFG009","languages":["config"],"title":"Docker socket доступен контейнеру","description":"Конфигурация монтирует сокет Docker daemon; доступ к нему может дать управление контейнерами и узлом даже при read-only mount.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-250","owasp":"A05:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"^\\s*(?:-\\s*[\"'']?\\/(?:var\\/)?run\\/docker\\.sock\\s*:|(?:source|path)\\s*:\\s*[\"'']?\\/(?:var\\/)?run\\/docker\\.sock[\"'']?\\s*(?:#.*)?$)","patternFlags":"m","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"file","category":"configuration","recommendation":"Уберите Docker socket из контейнера или используйте отдельный proxy с минимальным набором разрешённых API.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/250.html"]}},{"ruleId":"CFG010","contentHash":"00971e9fd460d92eecbc7288ab186507a9127cfb76f37d0fe1c92fc31958488e","definition":{"id":"CFG010","languages":["config"],"title":"Опасные capabilities контейнера","description":"Контейнер получает SYS_ADMIN или полный набор capabilities, что значительно расширяет его привилегии.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-250","owasp":"A05:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"\\b(?:cap_add|add)\\s*:\\s*(?:\\[[^\\]\\n]*\\b(?:SYS_ADMIN|ALL)\\b[^\\]\\n]*\\]|(?:\\r?\\n\\s*-\\s*[\"'']?[A-Z_]+[\"'']?\\s*)*\\r?\\n\\s*-\\s*[\"'']?(?:SYS_ADMIN|ALL)[\"'']?\\b)","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"file","category":"configuration","recommendation":"Удалите SYS_ADMIN и ALL; сбросьте capabilities и добавьте только необходимые для конкретной операции.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/250.html"]}},{"ruleId":"CFG011","contentHash":"334470f89b7a712565c3f09b0558377cf294e1f93a0ee87e650ed1f7962e21aa","definition":{"id":"CFG011","languages":["config"],"title":"Отключён seccomp контейнера","description":"Контейнер явно запускается без фильтра системных вызовов seccomp.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-693","owasp":"A05:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"\\bseccomp\\s*[:=]\\s*unconfined\\b|\\bseccompProfile\\s*:\\s*(?:\\{\\s*type\\s*:\\s*[\"'']?Unconfined[\"'']?\\s*\\}|\\s*\\n\\s*type\\s*:\\s*[\"'']?Unconfined[\"'']?\\b)","patternFlags":"i","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"file","category":"configuration","recommendation":"Используйте seccompProfile.type: RuntimeDefault или ограниченный профиль Localhost; удалите seccomp=unconfined.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/693.html"]}},{"ruleId":"SEC010","contentHash":"a07c65e346e515176cecd7cdf911acc0cda9cd03ea32028356e7cfa903f8efa0","definition":{"id":"SEC010","languages":["javascript","typescript","python","java","php","go","csharp","ruby","kotlin","rust","swift","scala","shell","config","unknown"],"title":"Секретный ключ Stripe","description":"Найден ключ Stripe для production API.","severity":"critical","cwe":"CWE-798","owasp":"A07:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"\\b(?:sk|rk)_live_[A-Za-z0-9]{24,}\\b","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"secrets","recommendation":"Отзовите ключ Stripe и загрузите новый из хранилища секретов.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/798.html"]}},{"ruleId":"SEC011","contentHash":"0e21868c6372076cbd436c73bd43418f2529d0f2db53ade95706ecac108e9240","definition":{"id":"SEC011","languages":["javascript","typescript","python","java","php","go","csharp","ruby","kotlin","rust","swift","scala","shell","config","unknown"],"title":"API-ключ Google","description":"Найден ключ Google API; проверьте ограничения API, адресов и приложений.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-798","owasp":"A07:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\bAIza[A-Za-z0-9_-]{35}(?![A-Za-z0-9_-])","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"secrets","recommendation":"Удалите ключ из исходников, ограничьте его назначение и перевыпустите при утечке.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/798.html"]}},{"ruleId":"SEC012","contentHash":"c6b276fa2683590eb1ac396924798eeffb5b67e5bedbe4f2b7b73bf90a79d0c0","definition":{"id":"SEC012","languages":["javascript","typescript","python","java","php","go","csharp","ruby","kotlin","rust","swift","scala","shell","config","unknown"],"title":"Токен GitLab","description":"Найден personal access token GitLab.","severity":"critical","cwe":"CWE-798","owasp":"A07:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"\\bglpat-[A-Za-z0-9_-]{20,}(?![A-Za-z0-9_-])","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"secrets","recommendation":"Отзовите токен GitLab и перенесите новое значение в CI secrets.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/798.html"]}},{"ruleId":"SEC013","contentHash":"81456759563110cc573b96089f3422f13d7c1635ba6a16040851619a81335395","definition":{"id":"SEC013","languages":["javascript","typescript","python","java","php","go","csharp","ruby","kotlin","rust","swift","scala","shell","config","unknown"],"title":"Токен npm","description":"Найден токен доступа к npm registry.","severity":"critical","cwe":"CWE-798","owasp":"A07:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"\\bnpm_[A-Za-z0-9]{36}\\b","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"secrets","recommendation":"Отзовите токен npm, проверьте публикации пакетов и используйте защищённые CI credentials.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/798.html"]}},{"ruleId":"SEC014","contentHash":"0e05864062e33c6a9f5471ed28d125218568e983a157c8e8622813942535c1e8","definition":{"id":"SEC014","languages":["javascript","typescript","python","java","php","go","csharp","ruby","kotlin","rust","swift","scala","shell","config","unknown"],"title":"API-ключ SendGrid","description":"Найден ключ API SendGrid с узнаваемой структурой.","severity":"critical","cwe":"CWE-798","owasp":"A07:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"\\bSG\\.[A-Za-z0-9_-]{22}\\.[A-Za-z0-9_-]{43}(?![A-Za-z0-9_-])","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"secrets","recommendation":"Отзовите ключ SendGrid и ограничьте права нового ключа.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/798.html"]}},{"ruleId":"SEC015","contentHash":"612d826384020e62a6888afa31a169f1391947dc329feccca0c6190b3010a5a3","definition":{"id":"SEC015","languages":["javascript","typescript","python","java","php","go","csharp","ruby","kotlin","rust","swift","scala","shell","config","unknown"],"title":"Ключ Azure Storage","description":"Строка подключения Azure содержит AccountKey.","severity":"critical","cwe":"CWE-798","owasp":"A07:2021","confidence":"high","pattern":"\\bAccountKey\\s*=\\s*[A-Za-z0-9+/]{86}==","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"secrets","recommendation":"Смените ключ Storage Account; используйте managed identity или хранилище секретов.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/798.html"]}},{"ruleId":"JS030","contentHash":"7451675c956e53f582335571677f34f08752b6f1f338bf4200e62761a885676b","definition":{"id":"JS030","languages":["javascript","typescript"],"title":"Динамический HTML через document.write","description":"document.write получает динамическое значение, которое может содержать HTML или скрипт.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-79","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\bdocument\\.write(?:ln)?\\s*\\(\\s*(?:[A-Za-z_$]|`[^`\\n]*\\$\\{|[\"''][^\"''\\n]*[\"'']\\s*\\+)","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"xss","recommendation":"Используйте textContent или безопасное построение DOM; очищайте необходимый HTML.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/79.html"]}},{"ruleId":"JS031","contentHash":"6c0c5cef72c60965f93d6dbddf2af39c8e41d45493463b311da7812a05752f72","definition":{"id":"JS031","languages":["javascript","typescript"],"title":"Строковый код в таймере","description":"setTimeout/setInterval получает строку кода вместо функции.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-95","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\bset(?:Timeout|Interval)\\s*\\(\\s*[\"''`]","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"injection","recommendation":"Передавайте callback-функцию, а данные — отдельными аргументами.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/95.html"]}},{"ruleId":"JS032","contentHash":"21db54e67e19d069c9dc9594c5b9d6b3099fd4a3ae028b247a03085673f71cdc","definition":{"id":"JS032","languages":["javascript","typescript"],"title":"postMessage без ограничения origin","description":"Сообщение может быть доставлено окну любого origin.","severity":"medium","cwe":"CWE-346","owasp":"A01:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\.postMessage\\s*\\([^;\\n]{0,300},\\s*[\"'']\\*[\"'']\\s*[,)]","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"authorization","recommendation":"Укажите точный targetOrigin и проверяйте origin входящих сообщений.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/346.html"]}},{"ruleId":"JS033","contentHash":"e71cd160719b8acb899bb22b4d60e30843bfe8fe6782f0ff23ab7e40c65a37e7","definition":{"id":"JS033","languages":["javascript","typescript"],"title":"Node.js integration в Electron","description":"Renderer Electron получает доступ к Node.js; XSS в недоверенном контенте может выполнить системный код.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-94","owasp":"A05:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\bnodeIntegration\\s*:\\s*true\\b","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"configuration","recommendation":"Отключите nodeIntegration и предоставляйте минимальные API через contextBridge.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/94.html"]}},{"ruleId":"JS034","contentHash":"53ceba2f5b53a559e6865145c9986206d870a14ef7a6c181f62fad36bb556a45","definition":{"id":"JS034","languages":["javascript","typescript"],"title":"Отключена изоляция контекста Electron","description":"Preload и страница Electron используют общий JavaScript-контекст.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-749","owasp":"A05:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\bcontextIsolation\\s*:\\s*false\\b","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"configuration","recommendation":"Включите contextIsolation и проверяйте аргументы API из contextBridge.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/749.html"]}},{"ruleId":"JS035","contentHash":"cfb2719e6c8301194a2d00568d2913c1518d31f0a234c034819ad307d6d9fddc","definition":{"id":"JS035","languages":["javascript","typescript"],"title":"Отключена web security Electron","description":"Electron отключает ограничения same-origin для renderer.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-346","owasp":"A05:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\bwebSecurity\\s*:\\s*false\\b","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"configuration","recommendation":"Включите webSecurity; используйте ограниченный IPC для необходимых обращений.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/346.html"]}},{"ruleId":"JS036","contentHash":"696926e66e75cdc3e7acc27a5225709c598953848f0db36ff031a80dc01ef2fd","definition":{"id":"JS036","languages":["javascript","typescript"],"title":"Регулярное выражение из HTTP-ввода","description":"HTTP-параметр становится шаблоном регулярного выражения; возможны инъекция шаблона и чрезмерное время обработки.","severity":"medium","cwe":"CWE-1333","owasp":"A01:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\bnew\\s+RegExp\\s*\\(\\s*(?:req|request)\\.(?:query|body|params)\\b","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"validation","recommendation":"Экранируйте метасимволы, ограничьте длину и сложность шаблона либо используйте фиксированное выражение.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/1333.html"]}},{"ruleId":"JS037","contentHash":"266b91b7f9d7555f7e7a48719fcba93bdf5bddbc125818f7c5b788fab1da9a26","definition":{"id":"JS037","languages":["javascript","typescript"],"title":"Отражение HTTP-ввода в HTML","description":"res.send получает значение прямо из запроса; если ответ HTML, возможен отражённый XSS.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-79","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\b(?:res|response)\\.send\\s*\\(\\s*(?:req|request)\\.(?:query|body|params)\\b","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"xss","recommendation":"Возвращайте структурированный JSON или экранируйте данные в HTML-контексте.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/79.html"]}},{"ruleId":"JS038","contentHash":"71c556ed722bb0bd34970111