\)\\s*=>\\s*(?:undefined|null)","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"transport","recommendation":"Используйте стандартный tls.checkServerIdentity и корректный SAN сертификата.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/297.html"]}},{"ruleId":"JS116","contentHash":"6c0838a111f44b1a50e1ce31ebb82c5852ac213beeca33dec26add8f9bea20f4","definition":{"id":"JS116","languages":["javascript","typescript"],"title":"Legacy Electron remote module","description":"Legacy Electron remote module. Найдена настройка, требующая проверки в production и ограничения предоставленных возможностей.","severity":"medium","cwe":"CWE-749","owasp":"A05:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\benableRemoteModule\\s*:\\s*true\\b","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"configuration","recommendation":"Отключите legacy remote module и предоставляйте минимальные IPC-команды.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/749.html"]}},{"ruleId":"JS117","contentHash":"0d89c305132f69ac6ad72313a330593b1f8f5f107832d9598c6c3f2730414dd7","definition":{"id":"JS117","languages":["javascript","typescript"],"title":"Electron разрешает mixed content","description":"Electron разрешает mixed content. Настройка ослабляет защиту соединения. Проверьте протокол и аутентификацию другой стороны.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-319","owasp":"A02:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\ballowRunningInsecureContent\\s*:\\s*true\\b","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"transport","recommendation":"Отключите allowRunningInsecureContent и загружайте ресурсы через HTTPS.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/319.html"]}},{"ruleId":"JS118","contentHash":"cd232ab00c4beef2c3a8e1b97c515d0a4244deadec317483ae93632de4eeadd6","definition":{"id":"JS118","languages":["javascript","typescript"],"title":"Загрузка скрипта jQuery из HTTP-ввода","description":"Загрузка скрипта jQuery из HTTP-ввода. Недоверенные данные или опасная настройка могут изменить выполняемую операцию. Проверьте границу доверия.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-829","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"(?<![\\w$])(?:\\$|jQuery)\\.getScript\\s*\\(\\s*(?:req|request)\\.(?:body|query|params)\\b","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"injection","recommendation":"Загружайте только фиксированные доверенные скрипты с проверкой целостности.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/829.html"]}},{"ruleId":"JS119","contentHash":"ff7a6ee6d49ead3402693b0794fb6b715194024f4be6f6eb37e5d6f854d192dc","definition":{"id":"JS119","languages":["javascript","typescript"],"title":"Отключена AngularJS SCE","description":"Отключена AngularJS SCE. При недоверенных данных возможен XSS; проверьте источник и контекст экранирования.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-79","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"(?<![\\w$])\\$sceProvider\\.enabled\\s*\\(\\s*false\\s*\\)","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"xss","recommendation":"Сохраните SCE и применяйте проверку HTML, URL и других чувствительных контекстов.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/79.html"]}},{"ruleId":"PY100","contentHash":"629e29ccb1422da6060b215db98e91c9d6d42fc7c13b4fb72c1d42205253bca3","definition":{"id":"PY100","languages":["python"],"title":"PyYAML unsafe_load","description":"PyYAML unsafe_load. Загрузка недоверенных объектов может выполнить код или нарушить ограничения ресурсов. Проверьте происхождение данных.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-502","owasp":"A08:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\byaml\\.unsafe_load(?:_all)?\\s*\\(","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"deserialization","recommendation":"Используйте yaml.safe_load и проверку структуры документа.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/502.html"]}},{"ruleId":"PY101","conten