Akka CORS разрешает все origins","description":"Akka CORS разрешает все origins. Настройка может расширить доступ к данным или операциям. Проверьте требуемые permissions.","severity":"medium","cwe":"CWE-942","owasp":"A01:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\.withAllowedOrigins\\s*\\(\\s*HttpOriginRange\\.\\*\\s*\\)","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"authorization","recommendation":"Укажите ограниченный набор origins для Akka HTTP CORS.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/942.html"]}},{"ruleId":"SCALA105","contentHash":"118cb88dc6760672562d4d16612e6cec454e0045b699a2b8214774ba1cb96b93","definition":{"id":"SCALA105","languages":["scala"],"title":"Scala Process запускает shell","description":"Scala Process запускает shell. Недоверенные данные или опасная настройка могут изменить выполняемую операцию. Проверьте границу доверия.","severity":"critical","cwe":"CWE-78","owasp":"A03:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\bProcess\\s*\\(\\s*Seq\\s*\\(\\s*\"(?:sh|bash)\"\\s*,\\s*\"-c\"","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"injection","recommendation":"Передавайте executable и аргументы без оболочки.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/78.html"]}},{"ruleId":"SCALA106","contentHash":"51a5280ec944b63c60cf34bc79ce0b831c60bfc40a72bb7bb7e4801d6ce24d14","definition":{"id":"SCALA106","languages":["scala"],"title":"Scala URL из HTTP-ввода","description":"Scala URL из HTTP-ввода. Внешний ввод определяет сетевое назначение. Проверьте адрес, схему и перенаправления.","severity":"high","cwe":"CWE-918","owasp":"A10:2021","confidence":"medium","pattern":"\\bSource\\.fromURL\\s*\\(\\s*(?:request|req)\\.","patternFlags":"","exclude":null,"excludeFlags":null,"scope":"line","category":"ssrf","recommendation":"Проверяйте URL и резолвинг IP по allowlist назначений.","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/918.html"]}},{"ruleId":"SCALA107","contentHash":"